  "definitions_zh_TW": [
    {
      "text": "蹤跡。同「蹤」。",
      "lang": "zh-Hant-TW",
      "register": "dictionary",
      "source_id": "moe-tw-concised-dictionary-2014-20260626",
      "source_entry_id": "5413",
      "verbatim": true
    },
    {
      "text": "1.隨侍的人。[例]侍從、僕從、隨從\n2.附和的、次要的。[例]從犯、從吏\n3.比至親稍疏的親屬。[例]從子、從兄弟、從伯叔",
      "lang": "zh-Hant-TW",
      "register": "dictionary",
      "source_id": "moe-tw-concised-dictionary-2014-20260626",
      "source_entry_id": "5418",
      "verbatim": true
    },
    {
      "text": "→從容",
      "lang": "zh-Hant-TW",
      "register": "dictionary",
      "source_id": "moe-tw-concised-dictionary-2014-20260626",
      "source_entry_id": "5547",
      "verbatim": true
    },
    {
      "text": "1.跟隨。[例]跟從、隨從\n2.依順。[例]從命、服從、言聽計從\n3.參與、加入。[例]從事、從政、投筆從戎\n4.向來。[例]他非常節儉，從不亂花用。\n5.自、由、循。[例]從今以後、從寬辦理",
      "lang": "zh-Hant-TW",
      "register": "dictionary",
      "source_id": "moe-tw-concised-dictionary-2014-20260626",
      "source_entry_id": "5551",
      "verbatim": true
    }
  ]
